WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.233
Welcome to the Man of Recaps,

00:00:01.233 --> 00:00:03.300
this is The Boys, Season 3.

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:06.566
At the end of season two, The Boys stopped
Stormfront’s evil Nazi plan.

00:00:06.566 --> 00:00:08.133
Though the true story was 
changed quite a bit

00:00:08.133 --> 00:00:10.000
for the movie about it, 
“Dawn of the Seven,”

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.033
and generally life has 
gone back to normal.

00:00:12.033 --> 00:00:15.300
the Superhero Corporation, Vought,
got off with basically no consequences.

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:17.100
But Homelander at least is under control,

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:19.433
because Maeve has the blackmail video 
of him crashing the plane,

00:00:19.433 --> 00:00:21.466
so they're all in an uneasy truce.

00:00:21.466 --> 00:00:23.533
And with The Boys no longer 
wanted criminals,

00:00:23.533 --> 00:00:25.066
Life is great for Hughie Campbell,

00:00:25.066 --> 00:00:27.466
who can now openly date his 
girlfriend Annie, “Starlight.”

00:00:27.466 --> 00:00:30.066
He's working at the newly formed
Bureau of Superhuman Affairs, 

00:00:30.066 --> 00:00:33.166
where he can stop bad supes 
from the safety of his desk.

00:00:33.166 --> 00:00:36.400
But out in the field working for Hughie, 
is his old team The Boys,

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:40.500
led by Billy Butcher, whose general vibe 
is an R-rated Captain Jack Sparrow.

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:42.633
They hunt down bad supes 
like the shrinking hero,

00:00:42.633 --> 00:00:46.166
who kills someone in a 
wildly graphic sexual accident.

00:00:46.166 --> 00:00:47.933
The old Billy Butcher would 
have squashed that supe,

00:00:47.933 --> 00:00:49.700
but he's trying to be a 
better person these days.

00:00:49.700 --> 00:00:51.333
Yeah he's in dad mode for Ryan,

00:00:51.333 --> 00:00:53.033
his wife Becca’s son by Homelander,

00:00:53.033 --> 00:00:55.066
and Billy Butcher is trying to be 
a good role model.

00:00:55.066 --> 00:00:56.866
Over at Vought, things are also going well,

00:00:56.866 --> 00:00:59.066
Starlight is now more 
popular than Homelander.

00:00:59.066 --> 00:01:03.033
They name her co-captain of The Seven,
and Homelander has to just accept it.

00:01:03.033 --> 00:01:05.033
But unfortunately the good times don't last,

00:01:05.033 --> 00:01:07.366
when Hughie discovers what we 
learned at the end of last season...

00:01:07.366 --> 00:01:10.666
His boss, Congresswoman Victoria
Newman, is a secret supe herself!

00:01:10.666 --> 00:01:13.366
The “Head Popper” that 
killed a lot of Congress!

00:01:13.366 --> 00:01:15.033
Turns out she grew up in 
a superhero orphanage

00:01:15.033 --> 00:01:17.300
for Supes with dangerous powers like her

00:01:17.300 --> 00:01:19.133
that accidentally killed their parents.

00:01:19.133 --> 00:01:23.000
But she was adopted by 
Stan Edgar, CEO of Vought!

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:24.900
And they have a loving family relationship,

00:01:24.900 --> 00:01:28.033
so Vought and its biggest opponent 
have been secretly working together.

00:01:28.033 --> 00:01:30.533
Meanwhile Homelander has 
been nonstop apologizing

00:01:30.533 --> 00:01:32.566
for not realizing he was dating a Nazi.

00:01:32.566 --> 00:01:35.133
But he doesn't actually feel bad, 
he still likes Stormfront,

00:01:35.133 --> 00:01:37.066
who by the way is still alive, barely.

00:01:37.066 --> 00:01:39.400
When she dies on his 
birthday, he finally cracks,

00:01:39.400 --> 00:01:42.033
and on live TV launches 
into an unhinged rant

00:01:42.033 --> 00:01:44.933
about how he's not “just human,” 
He's a freaking superhero!

00:01:44.933 --> 00:01:48.133
and he's tired of apologizing
for being better than everyone.

00:01:48.133 --> 00:01:50.300
But turns out some people
like unhinged rants,

00:01:50.300 --> 00:01:52.233
and overall his numbers are up.

00:01:52.233 --> 00:01:54.666
So Homelander realizes he doesn't 
have to please everyone,

00:01:54.666 --> 00:01:56.900
Some people will love him 
for being himself,

00:01:56.900 --> 00:01:59.100
he can do whatever he wants!

00:01:59.100 --> 00:02:01.166
And he starts by calling Starlight’s bluff,

00:02:01.166 --> 00:02:03.000
“Go ahead, release that plane video.”

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:06.933
“If you do, I'll finally go full evil
Superman and conquer the world.”

00:02:06.933 --> 00:02:09.000
And we get a deeper look 
into Homelander's mind,

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:11.366
he's kind of got a 
Gollum split personality.

00:02:11.366 --> 00:02:14.900
In some ways he’s still a sad little boy, 
who was raised in a lab without parents

00:02:14.900 --> 00:02:17.033
and so desperately craves
love and affection.

00:02:17.033 --> 00:02:19.500
but he has a dark side
that doesn't want their love.

00:02:19.500 --> 00:02:22.200
“You're better than everyone, 
you don't need them.”

00:02:22.200 --> 00:02:26.066
So finding a way to kill Homelander
just became top priority again.

00:02:26.066 --> 00:02:28.366
But that was always top 
priority for Billy Butcher,

00:02:28.366 --> 00:02:30.300
who's secretly been working 
with Queen Maeve.

00:02:30.300 --> 00:02:32.900
She's been looking into the death
of the first Supe, Soldier Boy,

00:02:32.900 --> 00:02:34.966
who was the leader of the 
original team, Payback.

00:02:34.966 --> 00:02:36.966
He was supposedly also invincible,

00:02:36.966 --> 00:02:39.033
whatever killed him could 
kill Homelander too.

00:02:39.033 --> 00:02:41.133
And so it's time to get 
The Boys back together!

00:02:41.133 --> 00:02:44.066
Hughie’s in, now disillusioned
trying to do things the legal way.

00:02:44.066 --> 00:02:46.266
M.M. quit the team to spend 
time with his daughter,

00:02:46.266 --> 00:02:48.100
though it's awkward because of 
his ex-wife's new boyfriend.

00:02:48.100 --> 00:02:51.766
But now he's back in because Soldier Boy
was the supe who killed his family.

00:02:51.766 --> 00:02:53.533
Frenchie and Kimiko never left the team,

00:02:53.533 --> 00:02:55.666
and they still have their funny
sweet romance going on.

00:02:55.666 --> 00:02:58.833
So Soldier Boy was a Captain America
type who fought in World War Two,

00:02:58.833 --> 00:03:01.766
then apparently died in the 80’s
in a nuclear reactor meltdown.

00:03:01.766 --> 00:03:03.600
His longtime girlfriend 
was Crimson Countess,

00:03:03.600 --> 00:03:05.800
So Frenchy and Kimiko try 
to get the real story from her.

00:03:05.800 --> 00:03:07.700
She doesn't want to talk though, 
and as tends to happen,

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:09.366
the whole thing turns into a bloody mess.

00:03:09.366 --> 00:03:11.800
So Butcher tracks down his 
old sidekick, Gunpowder,

00:03:11.800 --> 00:03:13.433
who, of course, immediately shoots him.

00:03:13.433 --> 00:03:15.700
But Butcher had a secret 
weapon Maeve gave him...

00:03:15.700 --> 00:03:17.900
Vought’s new temporary Compound V!

00:03:17.900 --> 00:03:20.200
Yeah this is Stan Edgar’s 
big plan for the future.

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:22.033
Supes in the military is a bad idea

00:03:22.033 --> 00:03:24.433
because most superheroes 
are wildly dysfunctional.

00:03:24.433 --> 00:03:26.633
But Temporary V they 
can give to trained soldiers,

00:03:26.633 --> 00:03:28.633
and the government will 
always need to buy more.

00:03:28.633 --> 00:03:31.800
So Billy Butcher juices up, 
now he's bulletproof!

00:03:31.800 --> 00:03:34.533
Goes full Homelander and lasers this guy!

00:03:34.533 --> 00:03:36.400
But he learned that Soldier Boy actually died

00:03:36.400 --> 00:03:38.366
in a secret CIA op in Nicaragua,

00:03:38.366 --> 00:03:40.866
led by none other than 
The Boys’ friend, Grace Mallory.

00:03:40.866 --> 00:03:43.533
It was the government's first attempt 
to put supes in the military,

00:03:43.533 --> 00:03:45.600
led by none other than a young Stan Edgar.

00:03:45.600 --> 00:03:49.000
They were at best, completely useless,
and at worst, a massive liability.

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:50.700
They ended up revealing 
the camp's location,

00:03:50.700 --> 00:03:52.833
and apparently in the fight
Soldier Boy was killed,

00:03:52.833 --> 00:03:55.033
by a mysterious Russian superweapon.

00:03:55.033 --> 00:03:56.933
Frenchie knows someone who 
can sneak them into Russia,

00:03:56.933 --> 00:03:59.300
it's his old boss Nina, 
from his criminal days.

00:03:59.300 --> 00:04:02.500
In fact Frenchie gets a big subplot 
overcoming the abuse from his former boss,

00:04:02.500 --> 00:04:05.566
and recognizing how it’s similar to his 
relationship with his current boss, Butcher.

00:04:05.566 --> 00:04:06.933
So Nina will get them into Russia

00:04:06.933 --> 00:04:08.700
if Kimiko does a hit job for her.

00:04:08.700 --> 00:04:10.533
But Kimiko hates that she's become a killer,

00:04:10.533 --> 00:04:13.333
and she has a big subplot not wanting 
to use her powers for violence.

00:04:13.333 --> 00:04:15.966
So she and Frenchie both decide,
after this job they're done.

00:04:15.966 --> 00:04:17.933
So The Boys find the secret 
Russian science lab,

00:04:17.933 --> 00:04:20.666
it's well guarded, but Billy 
Butcher's on that Temp V,

00:04:20.666 --> 00:04:22.566
Laser eyes! “Diabolical.”

00:04:22.566 --> 00:04:24.400
Earlier Hughie learned 
about the Temp V,

00:04:24.400 --> 00:04:27.533
So he took some too and whoa! 
He's got teleporting powers!

00:04:27.533 --> 00:04:31.466
So now they discover the Russian 
supe-killing weapon... does not exist!

00:04:31.466 --> 00:04:33.800
Soldier Boy is in fact still alive!

00:04:33.800 --> 00:04:36.000
Yeah they've had him this whole time,
doing experiments on him,

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:39.666
in fact they blasted him with radiation 
which gave him a new explosive power.

00:04:39.666 --> 00:04:42.066
And being hit with it seems to 
take away super powers,

00:04:42.066 --> 00:04:43.833
Kimiko’s healing does not kick in.

00:04:43.833 --> 00:04:45.633
And Soldier Boy ran off, 
he's in the wind,

00:04:45.633 --> 00:04:47.466
so The Boys come home empty handed.

00:04:47.466 --> 00:04:49.466
Starlight’s been busy with the reality show

00:04:49.466 --> 00:04:51.300
to pick the next hero to be in The Seven.

00:04:51.300 --> 00:04:54.333
And Starlight picks Supersonic, 
who is in a superhero boyband,

00:04:54.333 --> 00:04:56.400
and in fact was Starlight’s 
teenage boyfriend.

00:04:56.400 --> 00:04:58.000
He's an old friend and a real good guy,

00:04:58.000 --> 00:05:00.200
that will have her back if it comes 
to a fight with Homelander.

00:05:00.200 --> 00:05:02.333
But Homelander's pick is a returning hero...

00:05:02.333 --> 00:05:04.833
Yeah, The Deep is back in The Seven!

00:05:04.833 --> 00:05:06.933
He's had a huge boost in popularity

00:05:06.933 --> 00:05:08.566
after escaping that Fresca cult.

00:05:08.566 --> 00:05:11.433
Though it's actually his new 
wife-slash-manager who's doing all the work.

00:05:11.433 --> 00:05:12.866
But Homelander doesn't like The Deep,

00:05:12.866 --> 00:05:14.566
he just wants a loyal lackey.

00:05:14.566 --> 00:05:18.233
And to prove his loyalty, he wants 
The Deep to eat a live octopus!

00:05:18.233 --> 00:05:20.000
Which for The Deep, 
who speaks to marine life,

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:21.300
that's his friend Timothy!

00:05:21.300 --> 00:05:24.200
And in a show full of disgusting 
graphic violence,

00:05:24.200 --> 00:05:26.500
somehow this scene is 
the most disturbing.

00:05:26.500 --> 00:05:29.266
Another member of The Seven 
is the speedster, A-Train.

00:05:29.266 --> 00:05:31.600
But with his heart problems,
he can't run anymore.

00:05:31.600 --> 00:05:33.466
To stay relevant, he tries to rebrand,

00:05:33.466 --> 00:05:35.800
but he doesn't successfully 
end racial tension,

00:05:35.800 --> 00:05:37.766
he just makes a new 
energy drink commercial.

00:05:37.766 --> 00:05:40.033
And so The Seven has 
seven members again,

00:05:40.033 --> 00:05:41.733
but unfortunately it doesn't last.

00:05:41.733 --> 00:05:44.000
Homelander heard Starlight and 
Supersonic plotting against him,

00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:45.600
and so he killed him!

00:05:45.600 --> 00:05:47.900
Stan Edgar doesn't like this
new Homelander off his leash,

00:05:47.900 --> 00:05:50.200
so he wants Victoria Neuman
to start an investigation.

00:05:50.200 --> 00:05:53.500
But instead she announces an 
investigation into Stan Edgar!

00:05:53.500 --> 00:05:55.566
“Sorry, Pops, but I gotta 
do what's best for me.”

00:05:55.566 --> 00:05:57.333
She made a secret deal with Homelander

00:05:57.333 --> 00:05:59.566
who gave her some Compound V 
for her daughter,

00:05:59.566 --> 00:06:02.333
because the best way to keep her daughter 
safe is to give her superpowers.

00:06:02.333 --> 00:06:04.333
So Stan Edgar has been pushed out,

00:06:04.333 --> 00:06:06.466
Homelander gets to be in charge of Vought.

00:06:06.466 --> 00:06:08.633
But it’s like, 
“OK, congrats, you win...”

00:06:08.633 --> 00:06:10.866
“Good luck running a mega corporation.”

00:06:10.866 --> 00:06:12.566
And Homelander runs it very poorly,

00:06:12.566 --> 00:06:14.700
his first step is to fire anyone competent

00:06:14.700 --> 00:06:16.566
and replace them with his own loyal lackeys.

00:06:16.566 --> 00:06:18.566
He makes Ashley Barrett the new CEO,

00:06:18.566 --> 00:06:20.800
and now hires her own assistant, 
also named Ashley.

00:06:20.800 --> 00:06:23.333
And the constant stress of 
worrying about being lasered

00:06:23.333 --> 00:06:25.000
has made her pull out all her hair.

00:06:25.000 --> 00:06:27.400
Meanwhile Soldier Boy 
made it back to America,

00:06:27.400 --> 00:06:29.966
and it soon becomes apparent 
he's hunting down his old team,

00:06:29.966 --> 00:06:32.200
because they were the ones
that betrayed him to the Russians.

00:06:32.200 --> 00:06:34.166
So Billy Butcher 
approaches him with a deal,

00:06:34.166 --> 00:06:36.200
They'll help him hunt 
down the rest of Payback,

00:06:36.200 --> 00:06:38.666
in exchange he'll help 
them kill Homelander.

00:06:38.666 --> 00:06:42.466
Now Soldier Boy is a hilarious play
on the Captain America man out of time.

00:06:42.466 --> 00:06:44.533
Steve Rogers was a really good guy,

00:06:44.533 --> 00:06:46.700
but it's more realistic 
that a man from the ‘40s

00:06:46.700 --> 00:06:49.733
would be a wildly intolerant 
mega asshole.

00:06:49.733 --> 00:06:51.600
Next on his hit list are the super twins,

00:06:51.600 --> 00:06:53.066
and everyone shows up at their house,

00:06:53.066 --> 00:06:55.233
which is not unexpected 
because they're hosting a party.

00:06:55.233 --> 00:07:00.433
In fact, today is the annual epic
superhero orgy, Herogasm!

00:07:00.433 --> 00:07:03.133
It is an absolutely wild scene...

00:07:03.133 --> 00:07:05.533
that I just can't show any clips from.

00:07:05.533 --> 00:07:07.266
Long story short, he finds the super twins,

00:07:07.266 --> 00:07:09.300
then loses control and 
destroys the whole house.

00:07:09.300 --> 00:07:11.333
Which is an unfortunate end to an orgy.

00:07:11.333 --> 00:07:14.100
Now Homelander arrives, and 
Soldier Boy is ready to fight him.

00:07:14.100 --> 00:07:16.233
“You're just a cheap knockoff of me.”

00:07:16.233 --> 00:07:18.200
“Oh no, I'm the upgrade.”

00:07:18.200 --> 00:07:20.633
Oh, yeah! Superhero fight!

00:07:20.633 --> 00:07:22.100
Homelander gets the upper hand,

00:07:22.100 --> 00:07:25.733
but he's not expecting Billy Butcher
to have laser eyes of his own!

00:07:25.733 --> 00:07:27.533
Hugie’s there too with 
his teleporting powers,

00:07:27.533 --> 00:07:30.566
and all three together, this is it, 
they're going to blast him!

00:07:30.566 --> 00:07:33.000
But no! Homelander gets away.

00:07:33.000 --> 00:07:36.533
Now Butcher and Hugie’s plan did just get 
a bunch of innocent people killed.

00:07:36.533 --> 00:07:38.966
And Hughie's been generally 
a huge dick this season,

00:07:38.966 --> 00:07:40.966
so he and Annie have a blowout fight.

00:07:40.966 --> 00:07:43.166
So Annie decides to fight 
Homelander a different way,

00:07:43.166 --> 00:07:45.566
on social media with her 
millions of followers.

00:07:45.566 --> 00:07:48.266
She tellsl them the truth, that most 
superheroes are terrible people,

00:07:48.266 --> 00:07:50.333
and Homelander’s maybe 
the worst of them all.

00:07:50.333 --> 00:07:52.066
Of course Homelander doesn't like this,

00:07:52.066 --> 00:07:54.000
but Annie catches him on live stream

00:07:54.000 --> 00:07:56.833
explicitly threatening her 
and admitting to murders.

00:07:56.833 --> 00:07:58.566
But Homelander is able to brush it all off,

00:07:58.566 --> 00:08:00.733
calls it “fake news” and 
makes up his own truth.

00:08:00.733 --> 00:08:02.800
And unfortunately, a lot 
of people believe him,

00:08:02.800 --> 00:08:04.866
like M.M.’s ex-wife's new boyfriend.

00:08:04.866 --> 00:08:08.733
And so in general there's massive unrest, 
and the country is more divided than ever.

00:08:08.733 --> 00:08:10.600
Now back to Butcher, 
Hughie, and Soldier Boy,

00:08:10.600 --> 00:08:12.600
next on their list is his 
old teammate Mesmer,

00:08:12.600 --> 00:08:14.833
who traps Butcher in a nightmare 
about his own abusive father

00:08:14.833 --> 00:08:17.600
and how he protected his younger brother 
Lenny, who Hugie reminds him of.

00:08:17.600 --> 00:08:21.033
But now Soldier Boy gets this guy, and 
before he kills him he tells him a secret...

00:08:21.033 --> 00:08:23.366
“Hey Homelander, you know 
how you were made in a lab?”

00:08:23.366 --> 00:08:26.166
“It was my DNA, I'm 
kind of your father.”

00:08:26.166 --> 00:08:28.500
But Butcher convinces him 
“He's not really your son.”

00:08:28.500 --> 00:08:31.066
And so killing Homelander 
is next on the list.

00:08:31.066 --> 00:08:34.366
Meanwhile Kimiko’s powers never 
came back, but she's happier than ever,

00:08:34.366 --> 00:08:36.100
in fact, she almost speaks again!

00:08:36.100 --> 00:08:40.233
In her mind she burst into song, for a
hilarious heartwarming hospital musical,

00:08:40.233 --> 00:08:42.166
and she and Frenchie 
have their first kiss.

00:08:42.166 --> 00:08:43.966
Just then though, 
Nina comes for revenge,

00:08:43.966 --> 00:08:46.066
and without Kimiko’s powers, 
they barely survive.

00:08:46.066 --> 00:08:47.600
So Kimiko makes a difficult decision,

00:08:47.600 --> 00:08:50.500
to protect the people she cares about, 
she wants her powers back.

00:08:50.500 --> 00:08:53.700
While Annie's in there stealing some V, 
she reads about this new Temp V...

00:08:53.700 --> 00:08:58.566
Turns out it's not ready for human use yet, 
after 3 to 5 doses, it's always fatal.

00:08:58.566 --> 00:09:00.766
“Hey Butcher, how many doses 
have you and Hughie taken?”

00:09:00.766 --> 00:09:03.100
“Somewhere between three and five.”

00:09:03.100 --> 00:09:04.900
But Butcher is willing 
to sacrifice himself,

00:09:04.900 --> 00:09:06.733
he's not willing to sacrifice 
Hughie though,

00:09:06.733 --> 00:09:08.800
and so before the final mission, 
he knocks him out.

00:09:08.800 --> 00:09:11.433
So Hughie apologizes to Annie 
for being a dick all season,

00:09:11.433 --> 00:09:12.800
and The Boys are back together!

00:09:12.800 --> 00:09:14.866
They need to stop this 
Soldier Boy - Homelander fight,

00:09:14.866 --> 00:09:17.433
because the collateral damage 
might kill a lot of innocent people.

00:09:17.433 --> 00:09:19.300
So Homelander knows Soldier Boy 
is coming for him,

00:09:19.300 --> 00:09:21.533
but his current super team 
is completely useless.

00:09:21.533 --> 00:09:23.833
A-Train reconnected with his brother, 
who told him about a supe

00:09:23.833 --> 00:09:26.500
that's been killing innocent black men
in the name of stopping crime.

00:09:26.500 --> 00:09:30.400
A-Train gets him to make an apology, which
goes about as poorly as any apology can,

00:09:30.400 --> 00:09:32.500
and A-Train’s brother gets paralyzed.

00:09:32.500 --> 00:09:34.966
And Blue Hawk gets off 
with no consequences,

00:09:34.966 --> 00:09:36.933
just like A-Train himself did

00:09:36.933 --> 00:09:39.766
after killing Huey’s girlfriend 
at the beginning of the series.

00:09:39.766 --> 00:09:41.633
So A-Train goes for justice himself,

00:09:41.633 --> 00:09:45.533
uses his speed to kill Blue Hawk, 
which brings on a massive heart attack.

00:09:45.533 --> 00:09:49.200
But A-Train survives, they replaced 
his heart... with Blue Hawk’s!

00:09:49.200 --> 00:09:51.800
And with a fresh new super heart, 
A-Train can run again,

00:09:51.800 --> 00:09:53.766
But he's got some 
soul searching to do.

00:09:53.766 --> 00:09:56.266
The Deep, meanwhile, 
had sex with an octopus.

00:09:56.266 --> 00:09:58.533
Then wants to bring it in 
as a third in his marriage,

00:09:58.533 --> 00:10:00.500
which his wife is not okay with,

00:10:00.500 --> 00:10:02.833
and she now becomes famous 
with her own exposé.

00:10:02.833 --> 00:10:06.766
The one member of The Seven Homelander 
can always count on is Black Noir.

00:10:06.766 --> 00:10:08.900
Turns out he was a member of Payback,

00:10:08.900 --> 00:10:11.366
we get to see him unmasked 
when he could still speak.

00:10:11.366 --> 00:10:14.000
And in fact he's just decided he's 
not going to wear his helmet...

00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:16.233
which, ironically, led to his brain injury.

00:10:16.233 --> 00:10:18.066
He has a chat with his 
imaginary friends,

00:10:18.066 --> 00:10:20.766
who help him process the trauma of 
when Soldier Boy was abusive to him.

00:10:20.766 --> 00:10:22.800
So he's fully down to 
help kill Soldier Boy,

00:10:22.800 --> 00:10:25.333
But Homelander's mad he never told him 
Soldier Boy was his father,

00:10:25.333 --> 00:10:29.166
and so he kills him! 
Oh, no! R.I.P. Black Noir.

00:10:29.166 --> 00:10:31.300
And so it's time for the final showdown.

00:10:31.300 --> 00:10:33.733
But Homelander's like, 
“Hey Pops, I don't want to fight.”

00:10:33.733 --> 00:10:35.400
In fact, he's got a surprise here...

00:10:35.400 --> 00:10:37.200
“Meet your grandson, Ryan.”

00:10:37.200 --> 00:10:39.300
Yes Homelander finally 
found Ryan's location,

00:10:39.300 --> 00:10:41.500
And earlier, Butcher 
tried to push Ryan away,

00:10:41.500 --> 00:10:43.800
he blamed him for 
killing his mother!

00:10:43.800 --> 00:10:46.100
So when his super dad tells him 
“That wasn’t your fault,”

00:10:46.100 --> 00:10:48.333
he runs right into Homelander's arms.

00:10:48.333 --> 00:10:50.500
So it looks like these two 
might forget their fight,

00:10:50.500 --> 00:10:52.700
and instead live as a happy family.

00:10:52.700 --> 00:10:55.366
But Soldier Boy is like “Wow, 
you're a pathetic man-baby.”

00:10:55.366 --> 00:10:56.400
“Wait, what?”

00:10:56.400 --> 00:10:58.566
Oh, yeah, he's happy to kill him.

00:10:58.566 --> 00:11:00.700
But when Ryan steps in 
to protect his father,

00:11:00.700 --> 00:11:02.333
now Soldier Boy is going after him,

00:11:02.333 --> 00:11:04.533
so Butcher steps in to protect Ryan,

00:11:04.533 --> 00:11:06.900
and he and Homelander 
put their beef on hold.

00:11:06.900 --> 00:11:09.000
But Queen Maeve still 
wants to kill Homelander,

00:11:09.000 --> 00:11:10.800
while Butcher is busy 
fighting Soldier Boy.

00:11:10.800 --> 00:11:14.400
The rest of the team comes to help 
him out, but Soldier Boy is very strong.

00:11:14.400 --> 00:11:16.333
A powerless Hughie is watching 
in the control room, 

00:11:16.333 --> 00:11:18.033
he's thinking about taking that Temp V...

00:11:18.033 --> 00:11:20.066
But instead he turns up 
all the studio lights,

00:11:20.066 --> 00:11:23.366
which gives Starlight a 
massive power boost, blam!

00:11:23.366 --> 00:11:25.500
Meanwhile Frenchie was making 
the super knockout gas,

00:11:25.500 --> 00:11:27.033
and Kimiko puts on her headphones,

00:11:27.033 --> 00:11:30.100
she's got her powers back and is 
willing to fight for a good cause.

00:11:30.100 --> 00:11:32.233
So they got the gas to 
knock Soldier Boy out,

00:11:32.233 --> 00:11:34.333
but oh no, he's going to explode!

00:11:34.333 --> 00:11:36.066
There's no time to leave, 
they're all going to die...

00:11:36.066 --> 00:11:40.900
But Queen Maeve sees her opening, 
runs up and tackles him out the window!

00:11:40.900 --> 00:11:42.400
Massive explosion!

00:11:42.400 --> 00:11:45.133
But because of Maeve’s 
sacrifice, they're all okay.

00:11:45.133 --> 00:11:47.100
Except Homelander is still around,

00:11:47.100 --> 00:11:49.366
and should take this opportunity 
to laser them all.

00:11:49.366 --> 00:11:51.466
But he doesn't want to kill 
them in front of his son,

00:11:51.466 --> 00:11:54.266
And so once again, Billy 
Butcher and Homelander

00:11:54.266 --> 00:11:56.466
find themselves in a temporary truce.

00:11:56.466 --> 00:12:00.466
And so the world goes back to normal, 
with the details of this fight mostly covered up.

00:12:00.466 --> 00:12:02.500
Soldier Boy survived, 
he's back in a tube,

00:12:02.500 --> 00:12:04.433
just now in America instead of Russia.

00:12:04.433 --> 00:12:06.466
And good news, Maeve survived too!

00:12:06.466 --> 00:12:09.866
And now with no powers and presumed dead, 
she's free to live a happy normal life.

00:12:09.866 --> 00:12:14.100
Starlight officially leaves The Seven, 
going to join The Boys as just Annie.

00:12:14.100 --> 00:12:16.000
Frenchie and Kimiko, having 
gone through their arcs,

00:12:16.000 --> 00:12:17.700
have decided to stay with The Boys too.

00:12:17.700 --> 00:12:21.633
And so the whole team is back together, 
including their leader Billy Butcher.

00:12:21.633 --> 00:12:23.533
The Temporary V did not kill him!

00:12:23.533 --> 00:12:25.633
...Yet, anyway. He is definitely dying.

00:12:25.633 --> 00:12:27.900
But until then, there's more 
bad supes to take down,

00:12:27.900 --> 00:12:31.566
Like Victoria Newman, who is now 
running for Vice President.

00:12:31.566 --> 00:12:34.200
Earlier she realized that Hughie 
and Annie figured out her secret,

00:12:34.200 --> 00:12:36.333
but she tries to explain, 
“I'm not a bad guy.”

00:12:36.333 --> 00:12:39.233
But she gave Homelander Ryan's 
location, in exchange for him

00:12:39.233 --> 00:12:42.833
having The Deep assassinate the 
previous Vice Presidential nominee!

00:12:42.833 --> 00:12:46.600
So we don't yet know the extent of her 
plan, but it's probably nothing good.

00:12:46.600 --> 00:12:48.933
Homelander is not - currently -
running for President,

00:12:48.933 --> 00:12:51.033
but he's developed a cult like following.

00:12:51.033 --> 00:12:53.100
And now he publicly introduces his son,

00:12:53.100 --> 00:12:55.800
but a counter-protester 
throws a drink that hits him.

00:12:55.800 --> 00:13:00.366
And Homelander's not having that, 
he lasers this guy! Right in public!

00:13:00.366 --> 00:13:02.800
But just when he thinks 
he's gone too far...

00:13:02.800 --> 00:13:05.533
Nope! His supporters 
cheer him for it!

00:13:05.533 --> 00:13:09.633
And Homelander's realized he 
really can do whatever he wants.

00:13:09.633 --> 00:13:13.033
And that’s where The Boys 
Season 3 comes to an end.

00:13:13.866 --> 00:13:16.033
If you liked this recap, 
hit that Subscribe button,

00:13:16.033 --> 00:13:19.200
for more of the best 
recaps of TV and movies.

